{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922180/extras/banner_story_EN.png?t=1745097147\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">When Chiyo and her best friend Akari were about to go home from university, a massive earthquake suddenly began to shake the entire building.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Moments later, the ground beneath them crumbled, plunging the two friends into bottomless darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As Chiyo wakes up, their university has transformed into another world entirely. Now, she must find Akari and try to solve the mystery enshrouded in the demonic darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922180/extras/Yachiyo_Chase.gif?t=1745097147\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922180/extras/banner_characters_EN.png?t=1745097147\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922180/extras/character_Chiyo_EN.png?t=1745097147\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922180/extras/character_Akari_EN.png?t=1745097147\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922180/extras/character_Yakumo_EN.png?t=1745097147\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922180/extras/banner_gameplay_EN.png?t=1745097147\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Carefully explore your surroundings, always ready to hide and escape from monsters. Sometimes you will need to be stealthy, at other times you might need to run as fast as your feet can take you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Aside from enemies, you will also have to avoid traps, find items, solve puzzles and even switch to another character to make further progress. You can switch between characters at will.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922180/extras/banner_features_EN.png?t=1745097147\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Customize your horror experience: You can adjust the intensity of horror events at any time. You can even select your preferred difficulty for escape events, changing the time you have to flee from enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hint system: You can enable hints to help with solving puzzles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">File system: An extensive database lists every character you have met alongside every important term, item and note that you have found.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Text log: Should you have missed or forgotten an important piece of dialogue, you can look it up in the text log.</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Missing Half","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2922180/1e413c7aeeb9b0ce8ea1ba0885f778fd0f884fd0.jpg"},{"name":"Kizuna and Bond","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2922180/6017892a07bcd9eb3bdcf40ba1a895c396d95fa0.jpg"},{"name":"Transience","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2922180/0cff102f34922853daf25fee76b0a5e6bd23452d.jpg"},{"name":"Hollow Reunion","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2922180/857e578d36c5e070d524605d1ae059ed3f69f808.jpg"},{"name":"Premonition","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2922180/9a897b6f57778da4fc528990a15c085e999bed7d.jpg"},{"name":"Abyss of the Layers","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2922180/ce3a5b18633a9a4de7ae240cdcc6755baaa96071.jpg"},{"name":"Yachiyo","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2922180/ec2794cdb37677c9e5eee7b76257cd3c02df934e.jpg"},{"name":"Eternal Presence","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2922180/bd5758dd696dd625acef1e8ff1b07892a145a679.jpg"}],"total":8},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2922180?t=1745097147","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922180/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745097147","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922180/c69ceba28f04e0341f07b1582595e526819f6549/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745097147","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922180/c69ceba28f04e0341f07b1582595e526819f6549/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745097147","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"This game features mature language, vivid illustrations with graphic depictions of bloodshed, violent confrontations, and spine-chilling ghost encounters."},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922180/extras/banner_story_EN.png?t=1745097147\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">When Chiyo and her best friend Akari were about to go home from university, a massive earthquake suddenly began to shake the entire building.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Moments later, the ground beneath them crumbled, plunging the two friends into bottomless darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As Chiyo wakes up, their university has transformed into another world entirely. Now, she must find Akari and try to solve the mystery enshrouded in the demonic darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922180/extras/Yachiyo_Chase.gif?t=1745097147\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922180/extras/banner_characters_EN.png?t=1745097147\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922180/extras/character_Chiyo_EN.png?t=1745097147\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922180/extras/character_Akari_EN.png?t=1745097147\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922180/extras/character_Yakumo_EN.png?t=1745097147\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922180/extras/banner_gameplay_EN.png?t=1745097147\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Carefully explore your surroundings, always ready to hide and escape from monsters. Sometimes you will need to be stealthy, at other times you might need to run as fast as your feet can take you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Aside from enemies, you will also have to avoid traps, find items, solve puzzles and even switch to another character to make further progress. You can switch between characters at will.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922180/extras/banner_features_EN.png?t=1745097147\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Customize your horror experience: You can adjust the intensity of horror events at any time. You can even select your preferred difficulty for escape events, changing the time you have to flee from enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hint system: You can enable hints to help with solving puzzles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">File system: An extensive database lists every character you have met alongside every important term, item and note that you have found.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Text log: Should you have missed or forgotten an important piece of dialogue, you can look it up in the text log.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Aoi Tsuyukusa"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922180/header.jpg?t=1745097147","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"2025 Saikey Studios","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257099682,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257099682/movie480.mp4?t=1742399604","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257099682/movie_max.mp4?t=1742399604"},"name":"EN","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257099682/2a62068c66f78c235ed1a92ad78a693204c00b9a/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1742399604","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257099682/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1742399604","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257099682/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1742399604"}}],"name":"Bonds of Yachiyo","package_groups":[{"description":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","name":"default","save_text":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","subs":[{"can_get_free_license":"0","is_free_license":false,"option_description":"","option_text":"Bonds of Yachiyo - <span class=\"discount_original_price\">$9.99</spa